Maintainer: Genotomi <dogukansahil@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Genotomi/erikos

Package: erik-desktop-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, erik-base, erik-theme
Recommends: gnome-core
Conflicts: gnome-tour
Description: Erik OS desktop edition defaults
 Pulls in the Erik OS identity and theme and sets the GNOME desktop
 defaults of the desktop edition. The GNOME welcome tour is not part
 of Erik OS: this package conflicts with gnome-tour and turns off its
 welcome dialog. The Erik appearance app greets new users instead.
